contentText:
Tinashe is having herself a moment.

The singer recently put out her eighth studio album, Popstar , to much critical acclaim and fanfare online, as her day one fans are taking a victory lap on social media. Tinashe took to X and Instagram and released a lengthy statement about often feeling like she&#8217;s been overlooked by the industry and some fans.

