&#8220;This moment is a testament to never giving up on yourself,&#8221; he statement began. &#8220;For years I felt misunderstood, overlooked, the butt of the joke… but I just kept going. People would say, &#8216;She&#8217;s still making music? Why hasn&#8217;t she quit by now?&#8217;… but I never gave up on myself or my artistry. I just kept focusing on my passion and love of music and art and kept creating things I loved. I inevitably reached a place where I no longer craved the validation of accolades, awards, or even mainstream success because it was too painful to care anymore.&#8221;

She then added that she that her hard work over the years has paid off and that she finally feels validated.

&#8220;That&#8217;s why this means so much to me,&#8221; she continued. &#8220;Because after all of these years, to finally be here in this moment and seeing the praise for this project and finally feeling seeeeeen and heard is unbelievably touching. Like I really feel it&#8217;s healing a huge part of me in real time. (but lemme not cry rn) I am truly grateful for everyone who has been with me thru it all cuz babyyyy it has been a journeyyyyyyyy. Thank you thank you thank you from the bottom of my heart.&#8221;
